WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.959
Ben gazed around, hoping that Winnie had seen Team Black's first victory.

2
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:14.951
To his surprise, she was hurrying toward him with a worried look.

3
00:00:14.952 --> 00:00:17.644
"Ben! Can I talk to you for a minute?"

4
00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:25.715
Ben gulped. What did she want to talk to him about? His eyes flicked to Zork.

5
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:28.099
Serena rushed toward him too.

6
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.267
"Actually, we need to talk to you."

7
00:00:32.268 --> 00:00:38.487
She pointed toward a quiet spot under a tree. "Over there."

8
00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:45.303
Ben followed the witches. He was so nervous, he thought he'd explode.

9
00:00:45.304 --> 00:00:48.246
"Winnie, what's up?"

10
00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:51.742
"We think Team Orange may be cheating!"

11
00:00:51.743 --> 00:00:57.295
"Whew!" Ben blew out a sigh of relief. "Is that all?"

12
00:00:57.296 --> 00:00:59.815
Winnie blinked in surprise.

13
00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:04.998
"Did you hear what I said, Ben? We think Team Orange is cheating," she repeated.

14
00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:09.576
"As in, breaking the rules so they can win Field Day."

15
00:01:09.577 --> 00:01:15.362
Serena looked back and forth from Winnie to Ben.

16
00:01:15.363 --> 00:01:20.632
"I think he thought you were going to break up with him, Winnie. Am I right, Ben?"

17
00:01:20.633 --> 00:01:23.681
Blushing, Ben nodded.

18
00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:28.153
"Huh? Why in the world would you think that?" Winnie asked.

19
00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:32.091
"Because you've been talking to Zork for the past two days," Ben said.

20
00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.113
"And you've been ignoring me."

21
00:01:34.114 --> 00:01:36.798
Winnie shook her head in confusion.

22
00:01:36.799 --> 00:01:41.632
"We can talk about that later. Right now we have to tell you what Serena heard!"

23
00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:44.518
Serena leaned forward.

24
00:01:44.519 --> 00:01:54.214
"I heard a rumor that Zork made some cuts in the rope with his claw during the tug-of-war."

25
00:01:54.215 --> 00:01:57.653
"That's a huge accusation," Ben said.

26
00:01:57.654 --> 00:02:03.055
"You can't accuse someone of cheating based on a rumor. You need actual proof."

27
00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:07.203
"We have other proof," Serena said.

28
00:02:07.204 --> 00:02:13.252
"Right before Mog's sack ripped, I saw Brunhilda mumbling to herself," Winnie said.

29
00:02:13.253 --> 00:02:17.811
"I'd bet my favorite broomstick that she was casting a spell."

30
00:02:17.812 --> 00:02:23.484
"She was mumbling right before Waldo got itchy too," Serena added.

31
00:02:23.485 --> 00:02:30.524
"And I suspect that she's going to try to use magic in the cross-country race as well."

32
00:02:30.525 --> 00:02:36.600
Ben stared at the two witches. "Even if this stuff is true, what can we do about it?"

33
00:02:36.601 --> 00:02:38.514
"We can talk to Mr. Freaky.

34
00:02:38.515 --> 00:02:42.667
Maybe he can take a closer look at the rope," Winnie said.

35
00:02:42.668 --> 00:02:49.484
"And we can tell some teachers to watch Team Orange during the final race." Serena scowled.

36
00:02:49.485 --> 00:02:53.103
"Ugh! I hate cheaters."

37
00:02:53.104 --> 00:02:57.729
"Some of the cross-country race goes through the woods," Ben said. "It

38
00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.770
won't be easy to keep an eye on all the runners at the same time." Anger

39
00:03:01.771 --> 00:03:04.782
flashed in Winnie's green eyes. "I

40
00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:09.185
don't think all the runners have to be watched. Just two of them!" Ben

41
00:03:09.186 --> 00:03:14.806
nodded, and Winnie and Serena hurried off to talk to Mr. Freaky. Ben

42
00:03:14.807 --> 00:03:19.810
returned to his team and told them what the witches had reported. Waldo

43
00:03:19.811 --> 00:03:25.492
shook his head. "I can't believe Zork and Brunhilda would do that." "Yeah,"

44
00:03:25.493 --> 00:03:32.526
Mog said. "Zork is a really good athlete. Doesn't he want to win fairly?" "Field

45
00:03:32.527 --> 00:03:36.096
Day is supposed to be fun," Jen said. "It's

46
00:03:36.097 --> 00:03:40.068
not supposed to be all about winning." Ben

47
00:03:40.069 --> 00:03:43.034
looked down, feeling embarrassed. Like

48
00:03:43.035 --> 00:03:46.954
Zork, he'd been thinking a lot about winning today too. He'd

49
00:03:46.955 --> 00:03:52.384
wanted to beat Zork. "At least I never considered cheating," he thought. Mr.

50
00:03:52.385 --> 00:03:56.023
Gwarg was getting ready to start the race. "We'll

51
00:03:56.024 --> 00:04:00.013
keep an eye on those two as we run," Mog said. "But

52
00:04:00.014 --> 00:04:02.302
we still have to win, you guys. So

53
00:04:02.303 --> 00:04:06.067
remember to keep running, no matter what." "Or

54
00:04:06.068 --> 00:04:10.665
keep floating!" Pixel said, grinning at Ben. Deb

55
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:15.871
had been quiet. "I'd never cheat," she said quietly. "But

56
00:04:15.872 --> 00:04:19.307
I'm going to watch for ways to outsmart them." ***

57
00:04:19.308 --> 00:04:28.048
Soon Mr. Gwarg was directing the runners to the starting point.

58
00:04:28.049 --> 00:04:36.130
The race would go around the school and then into the woods before returning to the school grounds and the finish line.

59
00:04:36.131 --> 00:04:41.055
"Remember to stay on the course," the teacher said.

60
00:04:41.056 --> 00:04:45.521
"Ready . . . set . . . go!"

61
00:04:45.522 --> 00:04:50.294
As Ben zoomed off, he shot a quick look at his teammates.

62
00:04:50.295 --> 00:04:53.995
The best runners on Team Black were Deb and Mog.

63
00:04:53.996 --> 00:05:00.591
Ben could float very fast, but it was going to be a huge challenge for him to beat Team Orange.

64
00:05:00.592 --> 00:05:04.209
Their runners were already off to a strong start.

65
00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:08.605
Scampering on all fours, Lon had shot to a quick lead.

66
00:05:08.606 --> 00:05:12.403
Gaby's long legs were helping to keep her in second place.

67
00:05:12.404 --> 00:05:18.840
Zork and Mog came next, with Ben, Cleo, Carly, and Deb close behind.

68
00:05:18.841 --> 00:05:25.483
That left Pixel, Waldo, Brunhilda, and Jen bringing up the rear.

69
00:05:25.484 --> 00:05:30.627
The runners circled the school, keeping their positions.

70
00:05:30.628 --> 00:05:34.147
So far Ben hadn't seen any signs of cheating.

71
00:05:34.148 --> 00:05:41.780
"But that could change," he thought, especially once they entered the woods.

